4. cast-in-cast     

===================================================
cast( cast(1677.217 as float) as numeric)    
1677.217     

===================================================
cast( cast(1677.2171111 as double) as numeric)    
1677.2171111     

===================================================
    
5. mixed arithmetic + typeof     

===================================================
999999.999999+ cast(0.00000001 as double)    typeof(999999.999999+ cast(0.00000001 as double))    
999999.99999901     double     

===================================================
999999.999999+ cast(0.00000001 as float)    typeof(999999.999999+ cast(0.00000001 as float))    
999999.99999901     double     

===================================================
999999.999999+ cast(0.00000001 as integer)    typeof(999999.999999+ cast(0.00000001 as integer))    
999999.999999     numeric     

===================================================
999999.999999+ cast('0.00000001' as varchar)    typeof(999999.999999+ cast('0.00000001' as varchar))    
999999.99999901     double     

